<h1 style="line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 26px; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="left">Notice: Professional Development Day for Managers is Postponed</h1>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Citywide Training and Development's Professional Development Day for Managers, scheduled for August 17, has been postponed.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">As a result of this week’s storm systems, the Jerry Hammond Building is experiencing an ongoing power outage. We are currently unable to confirm a restoration date.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We will communicate further information about <a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2026/08/14/file_attachments/3746573/Professional%20Development%20Day%20Revised%202026.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Professional Development Day</a> when available.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Thanks.</p>
