      <pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 11:35:11 -0500</pubDate>
      <title>Reminder: Register for Professional Development Day for Managers - August 17</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">69506527</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/42495df</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none;">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="background-color: #00539b; padding: 0px;" bgcolor="#00539b">

</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr><td align="center"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/08/14138043/ctd-logo_original.png" style="width: 158px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Logo" width="158" height="115"></td></tr></table>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Citywide Training and Development (CTD) takes pride in being the hub for growth and learning for City of Columbus employees.</p>
<table class="gd_combo_table" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
  <tr>
    <td>
      <img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/08/14173151/7062200/light-brown-creative-ripped-photo-frame-moments-mem_crop.png" style="width: 179px; height: auto !important; float: right; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Reno CTD" width="179" height="228" align="right" hspace="7">
      <p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">On August 17, managers across the City will have the opportunity to connect, grow together, and interact with CTD as the team opens up its newly renovated space to host Professional Development Day for Managers.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Managers are often focused on helping other employees to grow and excel, but this session will focus on driving YOU to reach your full potential as a leader. Attendees will explore resources, network, and learn more about dedicated offerings available through CTD, including one-on-one coaching, leadership development programs, and even public speaking support.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Attendees are encouraged to stay for the entire afternoon to experience the full open house, but are welcome to leave as needed.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><a href="https://app.smartsheet.com/b/form/019fc9126ecc7c36b77168f7cfea96d6?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Register today</a> to take the next step on your leadership journey.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Professional Development Day for Managers</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Date: Monday, August 17, 2026</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Time: 1:00 pm. – 4:00 p.m.</strong></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Place: 1111 E. Broad St., Columbus, OH 43205 (Jerry Hammond Building)</strong></p>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2026/08/14172437/7062201/professional-development-day-revised-2026_crop.jpg" style="width: 560px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Open House Flyer" width="560" height="725">
</td>
</tr>
</table>
